    "html": "<p>The table shows the acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> of an object undergoing simple harmonic motion at various displacements <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> from its equilibrium position.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> / mm</th><th><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> / mm s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-20.0\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-40.0\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"15.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-60.0\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the period of oscillation for this object?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.5\\pi\"></span> s</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi\"></span> s</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\pi\"></span> s</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\\pi\"></span> s</p></li></ol>"
